---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import JournalNav from '../../components/JournalNav.astro';

const lang = 'en';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Editorial Board | Ayamatma"
  description="Editorial board and editorial roles for Ayamatma: Journal of Vedantic Studies."
  lang={lang}
>
  <section class="section stack">
    <p class="eyebrow">Editorial Board</p>
    <h1 class="section-title">Editorial Board</h1>
    <p class="muted">
      Editorial roles will be listed transparently as the journal develops.
    </p>
    <JournalNav />
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Editor-in-Chief</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Kiran Boggavarapu</strong><br />
        Professor of Chemistry &amp; Physics, McNeese State University<br />
        Founding Editor, Ayamatma Press
      </p>

      <h2>Editorial Board</h2>
      <p>
        The editorial board is being assembled. Board members will be listed with name, affiliation,
        field of competence, and role only after they have agreed to serve.
      </p>

      <h2>Planned areas of editorial competence</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Vedānta and Hindu philosophical traditions.</li>
        <li>Sanskrit textual interpretation and translation.</li>
        <li>Philosophy of religion and comparative philosophy.</li>
        <li>Consciousness studies and philosophy of mind.</li>
        <li>Science, method, and public reasoning.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Conflict handling</h2>
      <p>
        Articles written by the Editor-in-Chief will require independent handling. The article page will
        disclose whether the piece was peer reviewed, editor reviewed by another reader, or published as
        a signed editorial.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
